four suppliers revoked from Original Medicare subsequently billed MA plans. F=
raud controls increasingly need to follow entities across fee-for-service, MA=
 and Part D rather than operate within separate claims systems.
Coverage pressure is beginning to affect provider utilization, not merely pay=
er mix.
